Shark hurts 13-year-old kid diving for lobster in California
A shark attacked and wounded a 13-year-old boy on Saturday while diving for lobsters in California on the day lobster season opened, according to authorities.
The attack took place shortly before 7 a.m. near Beacons Beach in Encinitas.
Chad Hammel informed the KSWB-TV channel of San Diego that he had been diving with friends for about half an hour on Saturday morning when he heard the boy asking for help, so he approached with a group to get him out of the water.
