The protagonist of Still Game wants to orient his career towards the catering sector
Ford Kieran, star of the Still Game, seems determined to move to the catering sector after it was revealed that he has been appointed director of a restaurant chain.
The 56-year-year-old actor is Jack Jarvis on the famous BBC show, which writes and co-stars with his many-year-old comedian partner Greg Hemphill.
The duo have announced that season nine will be the last of the series, and it appears Kiernan is making plans for his life after Craiglang.
According to the official register, he is the director of Adriftmorn Limited.
