"People who leave their countries of origin on the grounds of persecution or threats by race, religion, nationality or membership of a social group or a particular political opinion," Sessions said when announced this directive on June 11.
The asylum was never created as a measure to alleviate all the problems, not even all the serious problems, faced daily by people around the world.
